{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1147.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"6199ae059414803dc2f6ec95497b0b9bdebbe348a31449915b35d626136dbfe9","ja":"美希のスペシャルアドバイス☆","zh":"美希的特别建议☆","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1147.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"39980c5983f31b11a1018081eecd8de9fe0ddbdd9fec323e6be9cf074c19455f","ja":"さすが美希ちゃんです！　そ、それで、\n叶えたいシチュエーションとは、いったい……？","zh":"不愧是美希！那、那么，\n想实现的情境到底是什么呢……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1147.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"092301957a8b8a397ea881bdae863622ca1c078e34d4b15746dc1a41d8f4ee4a","ja":"えっとね、ミキは、観覧車に乗って、\n大好きな人と一緒に夕陽を眺めたいって思うな☆","zh":"那个呀，美希想坐上摩天轮，\n和最喜欢的人一起眺望夕阳呢☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1147.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"e6cd4569ce021c85e0a3fa9e9e14be7c973e83173e4b7202777c73d88fa40969","ja":"へぇ……なんかすっごく、\nロマンチックだなぁ……！","zh":"哇……感觉超级\n浪漫的呢……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1147.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"a4b879a777edb752d5b610c9b3e90787f30da13f987d53a5a557b3a812340ae3","ja":"ふ、ふお～～～っ！　美希ちゃんとふたりきりで\n観覧車に……そ、そんな天国がこの世にあるなんて！","zh":"呼、呼哇～～～！　能和小美希两个人单独\n坐摩天轮……这、这个世上居然存在这等天堂！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1147.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"19e243d8f4b5ef05042a495a9f91b6a17ea3579c470855ef582da80253f2e377","ja":"でしょでしょ！　それでね、ミキが出た番組なら\n●●●●プロデューサーは絶対見てくれるから……。","zh":"对吧对吧！所以呢，只要是美希上的节目，\n●●●●制作人就一定会看的……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1147.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"8f65e7872b4218ef42144e5865e6c2ba375d4b53d6747f29cd2f0fa6c298946d","ja":"そしたら絶対、ミキと一緒に\n観覧車に乗りたくなっちゃうの。あはっ☆","zh":"到时肯定会变得想和美希一起\n坐摩天轮的。啊哈☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1147.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"8f45730955230db48c7778700a774b5103a8250671bfe69bd6f9b4ddf93f3e4e","ja":"なんと……！　そんな狙いまで！","zh":"竟然……！连这种目的都有！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1147.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"2f07f474f303e09a248e31b42c1b3c127c6fe7a72576500f9b7cd90e4193a46c","ja":"すごいなあ、美希は。\nアタシはそこまで正直に話せないかも……。","zh":"好厉害啊，美希。\n我可能没办法那么坦率地全都说出来……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1147.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"f59b8fcc2ccc97c07f890dda4592a9d017e739efe8337790be129597944fae41","ja":"でも、せっかく自分の夢を映像にしてくれるなら、\n正直にならないともったいないって思うな。","zh":"不过，既然难得要将自己的梦想拍成影像，\n我觉得如果不坦率面对的话，就太可惜了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1147.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"e473e2095d709ffde51d68eaab5b38b9b7b681fd38fe10b861f8212ea7a2bacc","ja":"歩と亜利沙のファンの子だって、\nふたりの本当のお願いが知りたいハズなの☆","zh":"步和亚利沙的粉丝，\n肯定也想知道两个人真正的心愿呢☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1147.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"1d6bca7a8a950c9541a89d05777c7d6d707b7a50168d6afc2198fdb0db55788a","ja":"た、たしかに！　アイドルちゃんのファンなら\nそう思うハズです！","zh":"确、确实是这样！如果是偶像粉丝的话，\n肯定也会这么想的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1147.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"f32e0d629d21a67335718dde3d0a855f2950af46cad6008ef33a999cf836e81a","ja":"ありさ、目が覚めました！　余計なことは考えずに、\n自分のやりたいことを叶えてもらうことにします！","zh":"亚利沙清醒过来了！我不去想那些多余的事，\n决定去实现自己想做的事情了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1147.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"e4df47982a146c8d223947aba97e04f68beff020848756ee2bfd2ff892b42e8d","ja":"そうだね！　アタシもそうするよ！\nアタシのやりたいことは……。","zh":"你说得对！　我也这么做！\n我想做的事情是……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
